Day 11 - Customer KYC Foundation

Enterprise Financial Data Platform | Customer Service | Oracle | Flyway | Spring Boot

1. Day 11 Objective

Day 11 extended Customer Service with a basic Know Your Customer (KYC) module. The purpose is to track a customer's identity-verification state and document metadata without storing actual identity files in Oracle.

Customer must exist before KYC can be created.

Customer must be ACTIVE.

Only one KYC record is allowed per customer in the current design.

New KYC starts in PENDING status.

VERIFIED status records verifiedAt and lastReviewedAt.

Actual document files are intentionally deferred to the future S3 phase.

